Gage the Cunning is a human of the [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei/Undercroft|Undercroft]] in [[Geography/Istria/Iomenei/index|Iomenei]], an exemplar who fights from a distance. He has piercing blue eyes, a crisscross scar below one eye, and wears dirty black studded leather. He is known for fiddling with things, getting in and out quickly, and hitting from afar.

He hunts the saboteur [[People/Gerhard|Gerhard]] with [[People/Barlow Crane|Barlow]] and [[People/Grant FireEye|Grant]]. The fighting pit's bookie, [[People/Varian Khan|Varian Khan]], has told him what he saw.
